# [WEB-SEO-2 2026-09-10] www.avatok.ai -> avatok.ai is NOT here. It was tried as
#   https://www.avatok.ai/* https://avatok.ai/:splat 301
# and Cloudflare Pages ignored the host-form rule (www kept answering 200), while
# the Astro adapter parsed it as a path and emitted a junk "/https:/www.avatok.ai/*"
# entry in _routes.json. The redirect lives as a zone Redirect Rule in the
# Cloudflare dashboard instead (Rules -> Redirect Rules, "[WEB-SEO-2] www.avatok.ai
# -> avatok.ai (301)"), which is the layer that actually sees the hostname.

